    {
      "game": "Code Vein",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/2041/450x258/code-vein-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1792119600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/2041-buy-code-vein-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Renaiko",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/24242389-1775155315.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Hi guys. I originaly bought the game on Steam, but that doesn't matter now.\n\n\n\nIt's a really good game. I loved it, spent almost 100 hour 2 years ago. I wanted play again but something happent, something bad. \n\n\n\nSO... You need to know something very IMPORTANT. If you have Intel 13/14th gen CPU then DONT BUY IT. \n\n\n\nThe game have issue with outdated OpenSSL in UE4(easy to fix, but the devs dont bother). \n\n\n\nSo if you have 13/14th gen intel CPU(what i got recently) in the BEST case you need to wait 8-10 minute just to STARTUP time(yeah, you heard right), but after that work fine, or in the worst case you cant even startup the game(depend on your luck and cpu you have)\n\n\n\nI just wanted warrning you guys, since you CANT refund keys. So if you buy the game with 13/14th gen CPU then get ready to have hard times."
    }
